<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested on a live basis, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wednesday: 100  Week to Date: 4,500</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs ld   65.10</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
